00:57:37.593 --> 00:57:42.463
-Why?
-You will give birth to freaks.


00:57:43.915 --> 00:57:48.066
-You have to be tough. Understand?
-Mmm...


00:57:49.918 --> 00:57:55.946
Never show your emotions.
You will wind up getting hurt.


00:58:14.678 --> 00:58:18.432
-Bye, Sebastian.
-Bye, Emma.


00:58:24.197 --> 00:58:24.871
Tough.


00:58:27.041 --> 00:58:28.680
Tough. Tough.


00:58:46.759 --> 00:58:49.992
What are you doing?
What are you up to?


00:58:50.240 --> 00:58:52.195
Give me that...


00:58:52.321 --> 00:58:55.200
It's a surprise.


00:58:55.322 --> 00:58:58.313
I will dance for you.


00:58:59.441 --> 00:59:01.476
Alright then.


01:00:34.209 --> 01:00:37.164
I will put it there.


01:00:42.769 --> 01:00:44.920
There.


01:00:45.768 --> 01:00:48.524
-Sebastian?
-Yes?


01:00:48.649 --> 01:00:51.245
Can you lay here until I fall asleep?


01:02:18.459 --> 01:02:22.086
You are so soft.


01:02:28.339 --> 01:02:31.375
You're the softest of all.


01:02:45.061 --> 01:02:48.337
Can you scratch me?


01:02:57.701 --> 01:02:59.577
No.


01:03:00.340 --> 01:03:03.413
Why? Why not?


01:03:03.982 --> 01:03:06.372
Because I say so.


01:03:08.381 --> 01:03:12.136
-Please, it feels so good.
-I said no.


01:03:17.184 --> 01:03:21.858
-Is it because we're cousins?
-What do you mean?


01:03:21.984 --> 01:03:25.179
Like you're not in love with me.


01:03:26.982 --> 01:03:31.819
If we wouldn't have been cousins,
I would not even be here right now.


01:03:31.943 --> 01:03:34.059
-Do you understand?
-Mmm...


01:03:44.225 --> 01:03:47.296
I want you to leave now.


01:04:40.036 --> 01:04:42.260
Mom?


01:09:26.773 --> 01:09:29.570
-Hi.
-Hi.


01:09:31.731 --> 01:09:34.883
-Do you need any help?
-No.


01:09:37.494 --> 01:09:42.725
-Why didn't you show up yesterday?
-I had to babysit for Sara.


01:09:51.691 --> 01:09:53.365
What are you doing?


01:09:53.493 --> 01:09:56.772
-You got something there.
-Don't touch me.


01:09:57.496 --> 01:10:00.054
-I said don't touch me!
-Calm down.


01:10:00.177 --> 01:10:02.449
I am calm.


01:10:03.494 --> 01:10:05.726
Move.


01:10:05.856 --> 01:10:07.810
Move!


01:10:07.935 --> 01:10:11.325
I said move. Get out of my way!


01:10:13.818 --> 01:10:17.015
You going to hit me or what?


01:10:18.377 --> 01:10:20.254
So hit me then!


01:10:20.376 --> 01:10:22.207
Hit me.


01:10:22.336 --> 01:10:23.769
I said hit me.


01:10:57.102 --> 01:11:00.136
Did you see what happened?


01:11:02.018 --> 01:11:04.168
He kicked me.


01:11:30.301 --> 01:11:34.818
Turn off the TV if you're
not going to watch it.


01:11:48.101 --> 01:11:49.661
Give it to me!


01:11:54.025 --> 01:11:56.695
-Give it to me!
-Emma...


01:11:56.821 --> 01:11:58.862
Give it to me!


01:11:58.983 --> 01:12:01.418
Let me have it!


01:12:01.545 --> 01:12:03.901
You old devil!


01:12:04.025 --> 01:12:06.981
Emma, you don't talk to me that way.


01:12:07.104 --> 01:12:08.822
Shut up.


01:12:23.265 --> 01:12:26.223
Take it.


01:12:39.548 --> 01:12:43.018
I made the team.


01:12:43.148 --> 01:12:46.583
How nice! Congratulations.


01:12:52.590 --> 01:12:55.624
I am so proud of you.


01:13:20.152 --> 01:13:23.904
-What are you doing?
-A hole.


01:13:59.235 --> 01:14:02.748
-Don't twist them too hard.
-I'm not.


01:14:03.393 --> 01:14:07.104
-Are there many left to go?
-Not too many.


01:14:22.358 --> 01:14:25.874
Lean your head forward.


01:14:26.359 --> 01:14:28.873
-Are you ready?
-Yes.


01:14:28.995 --> 01:14:32.624
-Are you ready?
-YES!


01:14:32.758 --> 01:14:35.352
Are you ready?


01:14:37.878 --> 01:14:40.949
Thanks for helping us out, Emma.


01:16:26.725 --> 01:16:30.979
Original subtitles by
KG SUBTITLING DIVISION

